{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in fast-paced gunfights in this stylish arcade with a top view! Hordes of enemies, colorful locations, four unique heroes with their own skills and exciting action are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one of four heroes, each with their own unique abilities and play style, and challenge your enemies in a variety of colorful and dangerous arenas. Level up, upgrade and unlock new abilities to become a true killing machine. A vivid visual style, intense gameplay and endless drive await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 unique characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A variety of enemies and exciting battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Character progression and development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fast, intense gameplay</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682680?t=1745631509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682680?t=1745631509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682680/2e24311cf5a6c393176433dad8a87923c0221dee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745631509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682680/2e24311cf5a6c393176433dad8a87923c0221dee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745631509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in fast-paced gunfights in this stylish arcade with a top view! Hordes of enemies, colorful locations, four unique heroes with their own skills and exciting action are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one of four heroes, each with their own unique abilities and play style, and challenge your enemies in a variety of co